## App-by-App Breakdown

### 1. TV Remote for Android TV — Best Overall

This is the app we built, and we're going to be upfront about that. But our bias doesn't change the facts: it's the only app in this list that is fully open source under the MIT license, completely free with zero ads, and has a verified no-tracking privacy policy.

The app uses the Android TV Remote Protocol, the same API Google uses for its own remote app. Auto-discovery works instantly on any network where mDNS is not blocked. The D-pad is large and responsive, the keyboard opens in one tap, and there's no account sign-up.

